# Review package: d85bae54bf1c1d93ff87e36304acfe1d297fd598..HEAD

## Commits
348853b feat: replace search page with vector search tool
4a9e2b9 feat: vector search form with method tabs and filters
9cc0548 feat: vector search results component
8748770 feat: proxy /api/search to FastAPI vector search endpoints
69e3e43 feat: add shadcn popover and combobox components
e37ca34 feat: vector search data constants and helpers

